{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_orchid_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_orchid_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "A6成立的那一天",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_orchid_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "87df9c3fdf1974e0c884ce0da7cb74cbc219c596e5e870774e37e483c819dec3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "泡普卡......如果你冲得太前，斑点是没办法护住你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "还有空爆。你的位置完全不对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "那个掩体位置太烂了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我要是蹲在那儿，视线就被挡了一半，还怎么炸那堆源石虫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "再说了。要不是斑点缩在后面不动，我也不至于被偷袭啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "哈？我缩在后面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "大姐，你看清楚。那是模拟出的高能源石炮击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "我不举盾挡在那儿，你和月见夜早就变成灰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "虽然现在结果也差不多就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "虽然结局是不太优雅的全灭，但在我倒下之前，我那华丽的剑技可是至少带走了三个敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "作为余兴节目，已经合格了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "呜......对不起......泡普卡没有看到后面的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡只是想帮梓兰姐姐把那个坏蛋锯开......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这不是谁带走几个敌人的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这是团队协作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我们是行动预备组A6。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我们是一个——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "拼凑起来的怪胎收容所。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "空爆，我听到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "唉，算了，今天就到这里吧，解散。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "梓兰，怎么愁眉苦脸的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "还能为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "哎，你说，斑点，空爆，还有月见夜，平时明明是挺好的人，怎么凑在一起就好不了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "确实，罗德岛上怪胎也不差他们三个，而且，大家其实都挺喜欢他们的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "可能有的人就是不适合凑在一起吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "我听说，行动预备组本来就是实验性队伍，要不然你去申请一下来后勤部？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "（低声）唉，但我就是不想坐办公室了，才会选择上前线啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你说得对，其实在我被告知要担任A6的队长时，人事部就告诉过我，我不必对此感到有任何压力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "那你为什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "罗德岛把他们交给我，一定是希望我能够用我的经验去帮助他们理解所谓的团队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "有个性没有问题，但重点是，个性要建立在互相尊重的基础上。他们缺乏的不是能力，是对彼此的尊重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "现在的A6根本不是一个团队，只是几个陌生人被迫挤在一个房间里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "......不不不，梓兰啊，罗德岛上有这么多厉害的人，哪里轮得到你来操心这个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但是我想操心也不奇怪吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我只是觉得，在要求他们配合之前，得先让他们认识彼此。不是作为干员，而是作为普通人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "只要建立起基本的社交联系，只要能坐下来心平气和地说话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "唉，你啊，就是心太软。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "让我再试一次吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "你确定？再试一次可能还是会失望哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "如果不试这一次，这杯热可可我喝得都不安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "空爆，那是最后一张牌了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "不许偷看斑点的牌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这叫战术侦察！\n斑点，你手里肯定是一对鬼牌吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "你的表情都僵硬了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "白痴，那是我的面瘫脸。而且......我赢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "顺子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "喂！你出老千了吧？哪有这么巧的顺子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "看来胜利女神今天也不站在空爆小姐这边呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "不过，斑点这招确实高明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "连我都被骗过去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑点哥哥好厉害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "运气好而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "再来一局？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "别急，我给你们准备了一些饼干和点心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "嗯......梓兰小姐的泡茶手艺确实高明，这是我这几个月来喝过最好的茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "谢谢，月见夜。对了，这几本杂志给你，上面应该有你想要的造型。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "这真是太贴心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "唔，这饼干还行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "比我自己买的饼干强多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "那我可以多买一点。斑点，最近没怎么看你出门，多吃点东西也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "虽然搞这种茶话会挺麻烦的，但这免费的下午茶我不讨厌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "好吃！梓兰姐姐最好啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "看到大家这么放松，我就放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "其实，我们完全可以相处得很好，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "既然我们能坐在一张桌子上喝茶，分享食物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "那我们在战场上，也一定能分享彼此的信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我想......我们可以试着更深入地了解一下对方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "不是作为干员，而是作为朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "比如，大家可以说说自己有什么喜欢的东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "那个，队长。我有话直说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "你给我们买东西，替我们写报告，今天还张罗这样的聚会，我觉得你人挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "但是，我一直有一个疑问，就是——为什么我们非得像一个团队呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我们会成为一个队伍只是因为罗德岛把我们凑巧丢在了一起，不合适就不合适呗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "如果是往常，我一定会站在你这边，梓兰小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "但今天，虽然空爆小姐的话粗鲁了些，我却不得不站在她这一边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "梓兰小姐，没必要强求。我们可以做同事，甚至可以做点头之交的朋友，但没必要非得演一出“相亲相爱一家人”的戏码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "没有必要，对你也是，对我们也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "队长，我能说的只有，别勉强自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "梓兰姐姐......大家为什么都走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "是不是泡普卡不乖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "泡普卡很乖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "是不乖的大人们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "搞砸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我喜欢夏天。\n在我还是时尚编辑时，我最喜欢的工作内容之一，就是做夏装的栏目。\n我并不是那种喜欢出门社交的人，但是，我喜欢穿着这些衣服的模特们演绎出的活力四射的感觉。\n它告诉我，有人在非常努力地活着。\n这种想法也会给我活下去的动力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "唉，怎么办，事情都变成这样了，要不然，明天我就去人事部申请调岗吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "唉，烦死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "身体又疼，空调也没用，这要人怎么睡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "止痛剂，止痛剂......\n啧，用完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "唉，去趟医务室吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我讨厌夏天。\n我讨厌那种将我的身体笼罩的热气。\n我更讨厌的是，当湿热的风吹过时，我的身体会隐隐作痛。\n在每一个湿热的夜晚，我都会疼痛难忍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "去医务室并不需要经过甲板。\n但我还是来了。\n连我自己也不知道为什么，或许是因为，我的身体知道，我想要的并不是止痛药。\n甲板上有一个人，他手里拿着一瓶酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他的脸上并没有平日的那种笑容，有的只是平静，还有一点忧愁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "......梓兰小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他想要把酒藏起来，不过甲板空空荡荡，他当然藏不到哪里去，只能尴尬地护在身后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "这个，我只是在散心——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......疼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "那就别动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我现在也没力气说你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "给我倒一杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "梓兰小姐会喝酒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "会，但不喜欢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我讨厌喝醉的感觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "哈哈，我的客人里，也有一些这样的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "不喜欢风月场，但是被迫跟着上司或者朋友过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "那你会怎么应付这样的客人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "把她们灌醉，好让她们付钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "真正喝醉的人不会付太多钱的，梓兰小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "愿意付钱的人，总是那些平日压抑自己，直到借着醉意，决定对陌生人付出一点真心的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你是说，我这种人，是你最好的顾客？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "她们都是我的好朋友，很好的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "说得好听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "这点斑点可以作证，我给他看过一些我和朋友们的合影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "对吧，斑点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "斑点？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "事先声明，是我最早来这里散心的，月见夜是后来突然冒出来的，现在你也来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "怎么，得了矿石病的人连晚上想吹风的习惯都一样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你也......你也真是不怕在这种地方看漫画把眼睛看坏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "我视力好得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "不过，老实说，队长大人，你现在的样子，可比平时讨人喜欢多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这倒是新鲜的夸奖......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你们经常在这里聚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "偶尔。毕竟斑点不是我喜欢的类型。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "凑巧，懂吗，凑巧。晚上会来这里的人可不少，只是今天，凑巧只有我们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "咦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "啊，梓兰姐姐真的在这！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "空爆，泡普卡，你们怎么会？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "我的眼睛疼，睡不着，想找梓兰姐姐，但找不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "我就去找空爆姐姐。空爆姐姐真厉害，一下子就找到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "空爆，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（低声）呃，队长，别误会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（低声）我本来只是想带她来我熟悉的地方给她点糖果吃，哄她睡觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "（低声）哪知道你们也在这。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "（低声）真的假的，这里真的有这么多人来吗？！我刚才随口说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......好吧，这才像你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "哥哥姐姐为什么都在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你的眼睛，现在还疼吗，泡普卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "疼，\n但是看到哥哥姐姐就好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你们呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "行了，又不是让你们述职。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "反正我很疼，疼得要死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "疼，不然小泡普卡大概叫不醒我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "不疼我也不会看漫画了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "我说过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你们谁带了药吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我出门的时候带上了，应该够我们几个人分的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "月见夜，你还有什么喝的，都拿出来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "其实斑点说的没错，许多人晚上会来这片甲板上散心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "所以我在这片甲板上藏了各种各样的饮品，以备“不时之需”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "哼，不时之需，说得好听。也就是说，应有尽有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "应有尽有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "机会难得，喝一杯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "真的，在这里，现在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "怎么，你以为我要让你们就地解散？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "嗯，或者至少你会跟白天一样说一些让我忍不住从这里跳下去的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我现在累了，没这个力气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "那你能不能多累点，我比较喜欢你现在这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "那是你还没有认识我，我平时大部分时候都是现在这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "要不是为了当这个队长，我才懒得用那套东西应付你们，你们还不领情，气死我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "但我确实就是不喜欢嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "好吧，对不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "干嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "没事，我只是觉得，看来我们之前确实完全不了解彼此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "泡普卡，你想喝什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "月见夜哥哥，我要喝苹果汁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我要琴酒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "月见夜哥哥~我要白兰地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "你自己没手吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "嘁，说得跟谁稀罕一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "我曾经在杂志上看到过一个说法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "真正的友谊，并不在于知道彼此喜欢什么，而在于，知道彼此讨厌什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "所以，我有一个提议。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "不如我们说一说各自讨厌什么东西吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "我先开始吧。我讨厌让人们无法露出笑容的一切事情，病痛，战争，仇恨，谎言，劈腿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "喂，怎么越说越不对了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "因为事情就是这样的，这片大地上让人们笑不出来的东西未免太多了一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这句话倒是没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "承蒙夸奖。空爆小姐呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我讨厌的东西可多了，无聊的生活，难吃的食物，没有挑战性的任务，哦对了，还讨厌拿着剑和盾的骑士老爷们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "你讨厌这么多东西是怎么活到今天的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "因为我活着就是要恶心我讨厌的这些东西，哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "别说我了，斑点，你明显讨厌的东西比我还多吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "怎么可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "我不像你，我讨厌的东西很具体的，开朗的家伙，自大的家伙，油嘴滑舌的家伙，太有活力的家伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "你直说你讨厌所有人算了。而且你完全就是在说我们吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "还没说完呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "你们虽然很像我讨厌的家伙，但看起来你们是例外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "呜哇，听起来也挺扭曲的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "我可不想被你说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这句话说成斑点讨厌我们以外的人类，听起来就好多了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "嘶，我后悔了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "泡普卡呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "我......我......我讨厌......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "困了吗，泡普卡，来，躺在姐姐的腿上，睡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "唔，我......不要，我要和哥哥姐姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "好了好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "今晚我看也差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "队长，你不会想逃跑吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "这可不地道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我讨厌矿石病，我讨厌晚上因为疼痛而睡不着觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我讨厌的是这一切不是我想要的，但我却被迫接受这一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "所以你才想用你的方法来和我们相处，因为这样你会觉得一切没有脱轨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我不知道，不过，你们可以放心，我已经放弃当一个好队长这件事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "今晚的事，我不会报上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "下一次的测试，我还是会下命令，但你们按照你们的想法去做就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "那真是个好消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "好了，喝得也差不多了，该回去休息了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "解散之前，让我们干杯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "好啊好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "......行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......你们白天可不是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "今晚有值得干杯的价值，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "但是，敬什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n那就敬我们现在都很疼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "噗，这根本算不上祝福吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "但我喜欢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "这倒是不赖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "虽然很疼，但是有人一起疼，感觉好受了一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "梓兰小姐，你知道吗，我的那些平日压抑自己，直到借着醉意，决定对陌生人付出一点真心的朋友们，都有一个特征。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "那就是，在她们说出自己的烦恼前，往往都觉得自己的痛苦是最独特的那一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你真以为我不会生气？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "你不会的，因为你知道我在说什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......知道自己的痛苦并不少见又不是什么好事，能和人分享痛苦，也只是分享一下痛苦而已，所以，憋着也不是坏事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "下次安慰人，麻烦你用简单一点的说法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "我们只是凑巧在这个夜晚因为某个共同的原因聚集在了这里，这不意味着任何事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但是，如果没有这个巧合，至少我就喝不到这杯酒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你对酒的品味还不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "承蒙夸奖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "十二点钟方向，重甲。斑点，顶上去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "啧。我这不已经在路上了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "喂！月见夜！别在那摆pose了，你想看着我被打死吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "别急，我正在找一个优雅的切入角度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "斑点老兄，你挡住光了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "月见夜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "别废话了，左侧切入！拦住那两个轻甲单位！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "遵命，梓兰小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "空爆！掩体后面的狙击手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "别管会不会炸坏掩体了，给我轰掉他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "喂，前面的让开！不想变烤肉就赶紧滚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "空爆小姐！你的榴弹差点削掉我的头发！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "没炸到就别叫唤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这就对了。泡普卡！去帮斑点哥哥！把那个大个子推开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "好！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "不许欺负斑点哥哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6小队",
      "text": "梓兰小姐！/梓兰姐！/队长！/梓兰姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "知道了！别催我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "战术旗——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我拿到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "累死了——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "C-？我好不容易努力一次，这分也太低了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "活着就不错了。知足吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "虽然评分不优雅。但刚才那最后的一击，我的姿势还是很完美的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "哥哥姐姐都很帅气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "哎，我以为斑点一定会摆烂的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "至于我，我本来就觉得有梓兰姐当队长挺好的，至少写保证书还能有人帮我想借口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "喂，称呼都改了，套近乎得也太明显了吧，我还说我觉得你会偷懒呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "再说，我也没说过我觉得梓兰当队长有问题，上次她还帮我找漫画呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "我一向觉得梓兰小姐是我命中注定的那位胜利女神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "斑点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "嗯，一起上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆&斑点",
      "text": "恶心的家伙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "梓兰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......你也来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "这不是担心你嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "不过，感觉A6比之前好多了。你之前说的办法真的派上用场了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "完全没有，这就说来话长了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "下次慢慢跟你说，今天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "知道啦，快去吧，你的队员在等你呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "去死吧，月见夜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑点",
      "text": "今天我要为罗德岛除害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月见夜",
      "text": "你们就算杀了我，也杀不掉这片大地上存在的那一颗真心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "梓兰姐姐，怎么办呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "好吧，泡普卡，把你的电锯拉起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "嗯？嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "行了，别闹了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆&斑点&月见夜",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "走吧，去食堂开庆功宴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "今天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我不请客，AA制。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "这么小气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "闭嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我还要攒钱买布料，哪有闲钱请你们吃饭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
